 "remarks": "Penthouse-style living in the heart of Springdale! Welcome to Unit #6R at Hyde Park. This spacious, top-floor corner unit offers the ultimate in privacy, comfort, and convenience. Completely move-in ready, the home features a bright and airy layout, freshly painted walls, and brand-new flooring throughout. You'll love the abundance of closet space and the convenience of a same-floor laundry room just down the hall. This unit includes a coveted, assigned garage parking space on the main level. Enjoy low-maintenance living with an HOA that covers heat, hot water, fitness center, trash and snow removal. Situated in the prime Stamford location of Springdale, you are just minutes from vibrant local shops, restaurants, parks, golf courses, libraries, and the Metro-North station for an effortless commute. Plus, take advantage of Stamford's coveted resident beach rights!",
